Frontier Risk Tier catalog

The four systemic-risk categories (Cyber offense; Chemical, biological,
radiological & nuclear; Harmful manipulation; Loss of control) and the tiered
capability-threshold statements in frontier-risk-tier-catalog.json are ORIGINAL
wording authored for AIGP-Lite.

They are informed by the structure of the OpenAI Frontier Governance Framework
(May 2026) as CONCEPTUAL INSPIRATION ONLY. The FGF is an institutional
governance framework, not an openly licensed catalog; NO verbatim FGF text is
reproduced here. The tier assignments, statements, and guidance are our own
governance-assessment formulation.

Attribution: structure inspired by the OpenAI Frontier Governance Framework
(May 2026). No endorsement is implied.
